 {'municipality':'Mississaugas of Scugog Island','municipalityCode':'3518022','searched':['https://www.scugog.ca/parks-recreation-culture/mississaugas-of-scugog-island-first-nation-msifn/','https://opendata.durham.ca/'],'reason':'No verified named sub-community polygon partition obtained. Preserve the official First Nation / census-subdivision area; do not label it as part of Scugog or a municipal planning neighbourhood.','fallback':'census_subdivision'}
